# HX1P35A HDL manual MIPI binding is owned by the dedicated DPHY0 hard IP.
# Its physical lanes are MIPI_CSI_D0/D1 on V14/U14 and V15/U15, with the
# clock on V16/U16; the project intentionally uses DPHY0 with two lanes.
# Do not add ordinary GPIO assignments for IO_rx_* pads.

